      "text": "Pictured: Iguaçu Falls"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:body:47f6c11f40afc686",
      "field": "body",
      "sourceTextSha256": "5bbb212b977ec4b1d565a633d2240463bd1d75c9453c3ee254941cd5be89d8e6",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-work-20261110-wnl41wwmag",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "\n\nRio and Iguaçu offer two very different experiences of Brazil. In Rio, the ocean, beaches and granite peaks are never far away, and city life unfolds along the waterfront. At Iguaçu, the focus shifts to tropical forest and a vast gorge, where the river plunges in hundreds of cascades. You can fit a lot into this short trip without changing cities every day.\n"
